<title>USA: Jamaica seeks 2,500 tonnes U.S. brown rice - agent.</title>
<headline>Jamaica seeks 2,500 tonnes U.S. brown rice - agent.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jamaica is tendering on November 18 for 2,500 tonnes of U.S. bulk brown rice under the GSM-102 program, agents for the buyer said.</p>
<p>The rice can be offered FOB U.S. Gulf for December 1-20 delivery or cost and freight Montego Bay, December 21-27 delivery, the agent said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
